        "subject_definitions": "<Subject 1>: The woman with the short dark bob, using only her facial appearance from the source picture. Source: <Picture 1>.\n<Subject 2>: The man with the narrow face and close-cropped hair, using only his facial appearance from the source picture. Source: <Picture 2>.\n<Video 1>: A slow lateral camera movement used only as a movement reference.\n<Audio 1>: The supplied instrumental music signal reused under newly generated dialogue and bread-contact sounds.\n<Audio 2>: Use only the calm low voice timbre from the explicitly enabled source audio channel. Voice of <Subject 2> (S1).",
