        "detailed_description": "Naturalistic live-action bakery footage with warm window light and fine film grain.\n\n[Shot 1] <Subject 2> sets the loaf on the counter while <Subject 1> watches. The camera follows the lateral movement of <Video 1>. At the first vocal event, <Subject 2> (S1) says <d>[English] Fresh from the oven.</d> in a calm conversational tone. Use <Audio 2> only for his vocal timbre. <Subject 1> remains silent.\n\n[Shot 2] At 00:04.000, a close view shows <Subject 1> taking the loaf. <Subject 1> (S2) says <d>[Chinese] 谢谢，闻起来真香。</d> with a small smile. The shelf card reads \"今日新鲜\".",
